:4,"text_representativeness":0.9280279874801636,"text_excerpt":"I have been coming here for years, actually since I was a child. I enjoy the crawfish (when they are in season, not a fan of frozen crawfish). I am not too fond of the boiled shrimp but I think that is a personal preference. The fried shrimp plate the other day tasted bland which isn't usually the case. Wasn't sure if it was because it was close to closing. I enjoy their ooey gooey cake. Occasionally the boudin is a hit or miss. I haven't tried any of their boiled crabs which will be next to eventually do."},{"business_id":"wGhlVNlqJmMFYqLIva3COw","review_id":"OOIRmfi8iv1E9CfFINscnQ","date":"2014-03-18T14:59:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9193305969238281,"text_excerpt":"Really liked it! I had the roast beef the first time, mostly because I'm new to seafood and dont love it yet, but someone else in my group had the shrimp and I had a bite and LOVED it, so that's what I got the second time. Both the roast beef and shrimp were awesome, as was the sausage that I had a bite of also. Very good food. Would definitely return. I traveled to NOLA with some natives and this is one of their favorite places - for good reason!"},{"business_id":"wGhlVNlqJmMFYqLIva3COw","review_id":"RLtH0hV_XY1W8GZUxupBQA","date":"2021-07-22T17:02:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9144267439842224,"text_excerpt":"Read Seafood is still a great spot to great some food. I order shrimp poboys and a chicken plate that tasted just like I remembered. The inside has not changed since the last time I was there, but still clean and well kept. I laughed because still remembered their number by heart. I will begin patronizing them again. Until we meet again."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
